    "description": "Move an open Agent task to a current direction or main: main moves any; a lead hands off only its own. Keep task, brief, criteria, estimate, origin and Agent; no message, interruption or restart. Refuses user-owned to-dos, assistant sessions and untracked work (adopt with agent_supervise).",
