  {
    "name": "task_plan",
    "description": "Plan multi-step work. Check machines_list, KB, agents_list and preferences. Main/lead, readonly, user_requested and preapproved tasks start now. Others and owner_step need 开始. Queued means dispatched. Reuse suitable Agents via agent_send. Keep reminders and events separate.\n\nAn explicit machine is fixed by default. Use flexible for portable work or omit machine for automatic placement. Leads own their tasks and escalate needs_user to main. Main can select a lead (agent_transfer persists). Use supervision_policy for incompatible leads. Match open issue or PR work with continues, todo_id or distinct_from. Other duplicate hints are advisory.\n\nWritable tasks need done_when and read-only tasks need goal. Set completion_mode for draft or review-ready delivery. Use continues and continues_why to carry work on, task_retry for failed starts and task_scope with scope_revision for scope changes.\n\nEdits need readonly=false and write permission. With readonly, Claude/agy uses bypassPermissions, Codex uses plan unless assistant.readonly_mode=prompt, and pi/cursor refuse. A leader can plan and review direct workers.\n\nUse repositories_list or repository_get when needed. An explicit repository URL or path takes precedence. Set machine and cwd separately from bindings. Non-repository tasks need no lookup (not a mandatory dispatch preflight). Only the owner can close terminals on acceptance.\n\nPass todo_id with a saved backend or container operation_id. Repositories for a new container must be ready. Host selects an enabled engine.\n\nWorkspace new isolates and can name a branch (default task/\u003ctodo id\u003e). Existing needs a clean, unused checkout. Queue waits FIFO if requested or the owner waits. Scratch uses a managed isolated dir (omit cwd). None creates nothing. Omit for none on readonly or the writable default (new if busy). Engine setup failure stops dispatch. Acceptance keeps workspaces. Respect org read-only refusals.\n\n`wait_seconds` observes up to 50 seconds after dispatch. Inline observation includes `completed` with this input's `reply`, `question` with a pending `interaction_id`, or `timeout`/`cancelled`/`unavailable`/`interrupted`/`failed`. Observation records known input and session ids. Observation never answers questions, accepts tasks, resends or cancels work. Normal supervision and `task_review` apply. Older nodes may time out rather than return an unrelated reply. Only an immediately dispatchable single task waits.",
    "input_schema": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "tasks"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "wait_seconds": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "description": "0/omitted: normal receipt"
        },
        "supervisor": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "optional leader id (assistant.leaders), selected by main; omitted: planning lead or main"
        },
        "tasks": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 1,
          "maxItems": 8,
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "title",
              "prompt",
              "role",
              "readonly",
              "user_requested",
              "why"
            ],
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "required": [
                  "cwd"
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "workspace"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "workspace": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "scratch"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "workspace",
                  "todo_id"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "workspace": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": [
                      "backend"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "workspace"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "workspace": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": [
                      "container"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            ],
            "properties": {
              "title": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "Card title in Chinese, under 20 characters."
              },
              "context": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "extra facts; no project background"
              },
              "prompt": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "goal, bounds and facts; manager adds context, criteria and rules"
              },
              "skip_project_memory": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "description": "default false; true skips project/direction memory in prompt"
              },
              "machine": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "Machine id; omit for automatic placement."
              },
              "machine_policy": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "fixed",
                  "flexible"
                ],
                "description": "fixed (default) or flexible (health-based moves for portable work)"
              },
              "placement_constraints": {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "description": "Optional auto-placement constraints when machine is omitted.",
                "properties": {
                  "os": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "linux",
                      "darwin",
                      "windows"
                    ]
                  },
                  "capabilities": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "maxItems": 16,
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "require_hub": {
                    "type": "boolean",
                    "description": "default false (excludes hub)"
                  },
                  "workload": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "light",
                      "standard",
                      "heavy"
                    ]
                  },
                  "candidate_machines": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "maxItems": 32,
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "cwd": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "Abs or ~/ dir; omit for scratch/backend/container."
              },
              "workspace": {
                "type": [
                  "string",
                  "object"
                ],
                "description": "policy; existing: path/id",
                "oneOf": [
                  {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "new",
                      "none",
                      "scratch"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": [
                      "backend"
                    ],
                    "additionalProperties": false,
                    "properties": {
                      "backend": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "required": [
                          "operation_id"
                        ],
                        "additionalProperties": false,
                        "properties": {
                          "operation_id": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "minLength": 1
                          },
                          "host": {
                            "type": "string"
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": [
                      "container"
                    ],
                    "additionalProperties": false,
                    "properties": {
                      "container": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "additionalProperties": false,
                        "properties": {
                          "selected_repo_ids": {
                            "type": "array",
                            "minItems": 1,
                            "items": {
                              "type": "string",
                              "minLength": 1
                            }
                          },
                          "operation_id": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "minLength": 1
                          },
                          "host": {
                            "type": "string"
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": [
                      "existing"
                    ],
                    "additionalProperties": false,
                    "properties": {
                      "existing": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "minLength": 1
                      },
                      "queue": {
                        "type": "boolean"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": [
                      "new"
                    ],
                    "additionalProperties": false,
                    "properties": {
                      "new": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "additionalProperties": false,
                        "properties": {
                          "branch": {
                            "type": "string"
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "launcher": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "listed launcher; empty: default/fallback, claude first"
              },
              "host": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "agy (companion) or enabled engine"
              },
              "model": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "model id/alias; empty: launcher default"
              },
              "model_aliases": {
                "type": "object",
                "description": "Claude Code IDs: sonnet_model, haiku_model, opus_model, fable_model, subagent_model.",
                "additionalProperties": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              },
              "permission": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "default",
                  "acceptEdits",
                  "plan",
                  "auto",
                  "bypassPermissions"
                ],
                "description": "mode; empty: writable default; TRAE/omp take none"
              },
              "role": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "worker",
                  "leader"
                ],
                "description": "worker or leader (starts/reviews direct workers)"
              },
              "ultracode": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "description": "large tasks only (Claude Code 2.1.284+ multi-agent); small: false; never in prompt/title"
              },
              "multi_issue_report": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "description": "Only for a report investigating several issues; requires a findings list before park or close."
              },
              "readonly": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "description": "true only for read-only tasks; false for authorized edits. Adds「本任务只读：不改项目文件、不提交、不对外写入」when true"
              },
              "work_mode": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "execute",
                  "research",
                  "coordinate"
                ],
                "description": "New task only. Defaults to research for readonly and execute otherwise."
              },
              "completion_mode": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "inherit",
                  "draft",
                  "ready",
                  "landed",
                  "verified"
                ],
                "description": "New task. Inherit uses assistant settings. Draft is a draft artifact, ready is for review, landed is merged or published, verified is confirmed live."
              },
              "user_requested": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "description": "True only if user's latest message asked for it."
              },
              "owner_step": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "money",
                  "outward",
                  "irreversible"
                ],
                "description": "money, outward speech, or unagreed irreversible step"
              },
              "why": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "Chinese one-line reason for machine, directory and model."
              },
              "done_when": {
                "type": "array",
                "maxItems": 6,
                "items": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "description": "Chinese checkable acceptance results told to Agent, one per entry. Nonempty for writable tasks; ignored with continues."
              },
              "goal": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "Owner's one-line Chinese outcome. Required read-only; writable defaults to title."
              },
              "out_of_bounds": {
                "type": "array",
                "maxItems": 6,
                "items": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "description": "Optional forbidden actions/areas, in Chinese, one per entry."
              },
              "continues": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "Original todo id (needs continues_why); reuses todo/brief, stops prior Agents, reopens if closed."
              },
              "scope_revision": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "With continues after scope change: exact task_scope scope_revision."
              },
              "continues_why": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "With continues: one-line replacement reason."
              },
              "distinct_from": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "todo_id",
                    "reason"
                  ],
                  "additionalProperties": false,
                  "properties": {
                    "todo_id": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "reason": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "minLength": 1
                    }
                  }
                },
                "description": "new tasks only: explain each conflicting open todo. Reasons stay in the brief"
              },
              "started_why": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "Non-owner-requested start reason saved in brief."
              },
              "attachments": {
                "type": "array",
                "maxItems": 8,
                "items": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "description": "Abs paths of chat files (Claude/app); copied with updated mentions."
              },
              "expect_minutes": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 0,
                "description": "Optional minutes override (0/omit: auto or 60m)."
              },
              "project": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "Existing kb_list projects slug/name; no near-duplicates."
              },
              "audience": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "human",
                  "autonomous"
                ],
                "description": "Optional to-do audience."
              },
              "direction_id": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "Direction id."
              },
              "part_of": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "Request todo this is a piece of."
              },
              "after": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "description": "With part_of: prerequisite pieces."
              },
              "todo_id": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "Caller's open/failed-start todo with no live Agent; equals continues if both set."
              },
              "inbox_item": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "Inbox ID or 'none' to skip. Omit for strong-match inference outside continuations. Never files or replies."
              },
              "tier": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "Agent preset from 模型档位; explicit launcher/model/effort/speed override."
              },
              "speed": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "standard",
                  "fast",
                  "ultrafast"
                ],
                "description": "new-start speed; standard/omitted: default; Codex: fast/ultrafast; Claude Code: fast"
              },
              "effort": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "Explicit effort; omit for tier/purpose default."
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "name": "task_plan_withdraw",
    "description": "Take down a plan card this conversation put up (task_plan) while nothing of it has started: its work was done elsewhere, or the user decided not to do it. The card stops waiting for the user's 开始, as when they dismiss it themselves, and leaves the to-handle lists (the snapshot's plans waiting to start, the briefings). Only for a plan of this conversation that still waits for 开始; a started or dismissed plan, or another conversation's, is refused and nothing changes. Your reason is kept on record; tell the user in a line which card you took down and why.",
    "input_schema": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "plan_id",
        "reason"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "plan_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "the plan's id (plan_…), as task_plan's answer or the snapshot's plans waiting to start give it"
        },
        "reason": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "why it is no longer needed, in the user's language, one sentence"
        }
      }
    },
    "defer_loading": true
  },
  {
    "name": "task_review",
    "description": "accepted closes after delivery_gate (default merged: park verified open PRs; linked issues must close). user_check keeps task/Agent open until owner Pass and routes feedback there. If opted in at Start, accepted done cleans the idle tab unless user_check; report closed/skipped/pending, never close tabs yourself. rework caps stalled/low-ROI churn at 2 rounds (external_input/substantive_new: 10 total); accept with a note over low-ROI edge/style nitpicks. Replace stopped Agents via agent_start. Use parked with evidence for external waits; needs_user if only the owner can contact, approve, or trigger work.\n\nFor accepted (outcome=done), list each done_when once in checks (met=true, nonblank evidence), even with user_check; outcome=cannot, cancelled and criteria-free tasks keep prior rules. Other verdicts may omit checks and keep progress. Report each criterion met/not_met/dropped, then also_done. Judge the scoped brief over handovers/Agent claims; uncovered scope needs needs_user, user_check, or a linked follow-up to-do—never chat text alone.\n\nIf an outcome decision or your review leaves part of the original brief for later, use needs_user to ask, or include deferred_scope with user_check or an open linked follow_up_todo_id. Keep the remaining scope visible even when every done_when check passes.\n\nGive accepted outcome/reason/link; pass direct PR/MR/doc URL in link for needs_user when available. The hub sends conclusion cards and passes verification unless user_check. needs_user can default to recommend at 24h/deadline; irreversible/visible_to_others only remind. Recheck at 24h. can_wait needs low cost, nobody blocked today and no deadline within 12h. “You decide”, “This isn't what I asked for” and “Tell me the background first” return to supervision. Clarify without repeating or acting irreversibly/externally.\n\nA non-main reviewer of another supervisor's task may only accept/cancel; send gaps via agent_send. A leader's needs_user reaches main too. Cancel duplicates/unwanted tasks. Viewing alone permits untouched cancellation.",
    "input_schema": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "todo_id",
        "verdict"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "todo_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "the task's todo id (todo_…), from the 督办 message or the context snapshot"
        },
        "verdict": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "accepted",
            "rework",
            "needs_user",
            "parked",
            "cancelled",
            "findings"
          ]
        },
        "findings_review": {
          "type": "object",
          "description": "verdict=findings: omit to read; supply the displayed version to confirm and record dispositions without moving task state.",
          "required": [
            "version"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "version": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1
            },
            "dispositions": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "id"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "id": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "follow_up_todo_id": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Independent supervised to-do with the finding’s exact next action in done_when."
                  },
                  "wait_target": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "A single finding may match the park evidence's target."
                  },
                  "done_evidence": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Evidence that this finding was resolved."
                  },
                  "owner_drop_decision_id": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Owner's manual decision, question 'Drop investigation finding \u003cid\u003e?', choice 'Drop', with reason."
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "rework_kind": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "external_input",
            "substantive_new",
            "repeated_error",
            "low_roi_edge"
          ],
          "description": "rework, optional: external_input (external review/conflict/owner input; skips 2-round stalled cap), substantive_new (prior gap fixed, new defect found; resets stalled cap), repeated_error/low_roi_edge (default when omitted; cap 2 stalled, 10 total)"
        },
        "checks": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "criterion",
              "met"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "criterion": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "one done_when criterion (or what the task was for, when it had none)"
              },
              "met": {
                "type": "boolean"
              },
              "evidence": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "proof it is met (link, command output), or what is missing"
              }
            }
          },
          "description": "each criterion with evidence/gap; updates state, evidence, time, and supervisor. Omitted entries keep progress"
        },
        "note": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "rework: what the agent is to do (Chinese, concrete); needs_user: what the user is to decide; parked: anything more than reason, for your own record; cancelled: why; accepted: the result in a line"
        },
        "outcome": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "done",
            "cannot"
          ],
          "description": "accepted: done (work complete or answer yes) or cannot (proved impossible); default done"
        },
        "reason": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "one sentence in the user's language: accepted (why; default note's first line), needs_user (required: what to decide), or parked (required: what it waits for; include PR link if waiting on a PR)"
        },
        "waiting_on": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "someone_else",
            "external_event",
            "date"
          ],
          "description": "parked (required): someone_else (person acts/answers), external_event (outside event), or date. Owner decisions use needs_user; legacy owner_priority parks stay readable"
        },
        "until": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "parked, optional: duration (\"3d\", \"36h\", \"90m\") or RFC 3339 time, 1m–30d ahead; default 24h. waiting_on=date requires explicit RFC 3339"
        },
        "link": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "accepted/needs_user: direct PR/MR/doc URL when available (shown on decision card); defaults to task PR/MR, note/checks URL, or chat"
        },
        "recommend": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "needs_user (required): recommended option label (first in options); owner OK sends it to the agent"
        },
        "why_owner": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "irreversible",
            "visible_to_others",
            "priority",
            "acceptance",
            "only_owner_knows"
          ],
          "description": "needs_user (required): irreversible (delete/prod write/spend), visible_to_others (external message/comment/review), priority (whether/order), acceptance (visual check), only_owner_knows (private fact); decide anything else yourself"
        },
        "options": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 2,
          "maxItems": 4,
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "label",
              "leads_to"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "label": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "short button label"
              },
              "leads_to": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "one sentence: what choosing it leads to"
              }
            }
          },
          "description": "needs_user (required): 2–4 options, recommended first"
        },
        "cost_of_waiting": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "needs_user (required): one sentence on the cost of waiting"
        },
        "question_quote": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "needs_user: the Agent's question verbatim when reason paraphrases it (hub checks for an existing reply)"
        },
        "can_wait": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "description": "needs_user, optional: defer to next daily briefing (low cost, nobody blocked today, no deadline \u003c12h); no push/card, listed in Needs you. Ignored for irreversible/visible_to_others, deadline \u003c12h, reversible=false, or no briefing with facts due within 24h and \u003e=12h before deadline; default false"
        },
        "deadline": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "needs_user, optional: how long the decision waits, duration (\"4h\") or RFC 3339 time, 1m–30d ahead; needs reversible. Default 24h reversible; none for why_owner irreversible/visible_to_others"
        },
        "also_done": {
          "type": "array",
          "maxItems": 6,
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "description": "accepted, optional: what was done beyond the task's brief (one line each); the task's page lists it after the criteria"
        },
        "withdraw_needs_user": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "description": "accepted only, task in needs_user: its supervisor or main takes it back and closes it silently (no card/push)"
        },
        "user_check": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "description": "accepted only: user must inspect result (e.g. UI change); shows \"Please verify\" card awaiting \"Pass\" instead of auto-passing; default false"
        },
        "deferred_scope": {
          "type": "string",
          "maxLength": 600,
          "description": "accepted: describe in the owner's language which work in the original brief is deferred or requires separate approval. The personal verification card shows the first 120 characters"
        },
        "follow_up_todo_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "With deferred_scope and without user_check, identify the open to-do that owns the remaining work. Its part_of must name this to-do, or its after must name this piece of the same request"
        },
        "reversible": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "description": "with deadline: whether taking recommend can be undone; false for delete/external send/spend/prod change (never auto-taken; required false for irreversible/visible_to_others)"
        },
        "evidence": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "kind",
            "target",
            "wake",
            "next_actor"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "kind": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "person_reply",
                "merge_review",
                "external_event",
                "date"
              ],
              "description": "External wait kind"
            },
            "target": {
              "type": "string",
              "maxLength": 200,
              "description": "The person or external object"
            },
            "wake": {
              "type": "string",
              "maxLength": 600,
              "description": "Observable change that ends the wait"
            },
            "next_actor": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "external",
                "owner"
              ],
              "description": "external: third party, system or time, without a prior owner step. owner: use needs_user"
            },
            "url": {
              "type": "string",
              "maxLength": 2000,
              "description": "Required for merge_review (ready PR/MR) and external_event"
            },
            "interaction_id": {
              "type": "string",
              "maxLength": 200,
              "description": "external_event only. This worker's exact pending owner request ID from agents_list. Shows the existing request"
            },
            "pr_event": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "terminal",
                "terminal_or_review"
              ],
              "description": "GitHub PR waits only. terminal for merge or close. terminal_or_review adds new submitted reviews"
            },
            "contact": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "channel",
                "url",
                "sender",
                "sent_at",
                "request",
                "status"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "channel": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "maxLength": 100
                },
                "url": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "maxLength": 2000,
                  "description": "sent-message/receipt link, not a channel homepage"
                },
                "sender": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "maxLength": 200
                },
                "sent_at": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "format": "date-time",
                  "description": "actual sent time; not in the future"
                },
                "request": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "maxLength": 600
                },
                "status": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "sent"
                  ]
                }
              },
              "description": "Sent request, required for person_reply and merge_review"
            },
            "ready": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "enum": [
                true
              ],
              "description": "merge_review only. The PR/MR is ready for the reviewer"
            },
            "reply": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "source",
                "brand",
                "app_id",
                "account_open_id",
                "person_open_id",
                "chat_id",
                "thread_id",
                "request_message_id"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "source": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "larkcli"
                  ]
                },
                "brand": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "feishu",
                    "lark"
                  ]
                },
                "app_id": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "account_open_id": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "person_open_id": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "expected human OpenID in this app, not self"
                },
                "chat_id": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "thread_id": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "provider topic ID, not root-message ID"
                },
                "request_message_id": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              },
              "description": "person_reply: exact IDs from a configured lark-cli reader, never names. contact.url must be the sent request's matching topic AppLink. A verified reply asks the current supervisor to review, not direct Agent delivery"
            }
          },
          "description": "Required for parked. Inspect the source. recorded_by is output only. Missing legacy evidence is unverified"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "name": "task_scope",
    "description": "The supervisor can change criteria, modes or the estimate. This log preserves the original brief and records changes and reasons for the owner's next digest, including criteria edits via agent_supervise or agent_send. Give the full done_when list. Removed criteria appear at completion. For an owner-only step, ask via ask_user or task_review needs_user and retry in the owner's reply turn. Notify the Agent via agent_send. Scope resets overdue. A new estimate also resets estimate_due. A finished task past the settle window without an owner card needs task_review first. Use needs_user or accepted with user_check when the owner must act.",
    "input_schema": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "todo_id",
        "change",
        "why"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "todo_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "the task's todo id (todo_…)"
        },
        "inbox_item": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Inbox ID to link to the existing task and its Agents. Omit to skip linking."
        },
        "change": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "what changes, in one sentence the owner can read (Chinese), e.g. 「不再要求灰度验证，改为只在测试环境验证」"
        },
        "why": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "why, in one sentence (Chinese)"
        },
        "work_mode": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "execute",
            "research",
            "coordinate"
          ],
          "description": "New work mode. Omit to keep the current mode."
        },
        "completion_mode": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "inherit",
            "draft",
            "ready",
            "landed",
            "verified"
          ],
          "description": "Omit to keep it. Inherit uses the assistant's delivery gate."
        },
        "done_when": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 1,
          "maxItems": 6,
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "description": "the criteria after the change, the whole list; leave it out to keep them as they are"
        },
        "expect_minutes": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "description": "how long the task should take from now; leave it out (or 0) to keep it"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "name": "task_decided",
    "description": "Record the owner's needs_user choice or user_check Pass (\"Pass\"); main chat or supervisor only. Quote their words and exact option; never guess. told_agent=true records only (already relayed); false also sends. Both settle the ask.",
